My Portfolio Visual Identity & Judgment:
My portfolio is designed with intentionality; the typography, color palette, and layout are unified to create a clean frame that never upstages the work itself.

Regarding visual judgment, I exercised strict filtering. For my project visuals, I deliberately rejected using any AI-generated concept art. I rely entirely on real screenshots and authentic photos of my actual execution, because a real screenshot of the work always beats generated fluff when it comes to proof.

The only AI-generated image on my site is the logo. Even there, I didn't just accept the first output; I rejected multiple iterations and curated the final result to ensure it perfectly matches the site's cohesive visual theme and professional tone.
